{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cooperative horror survival game for 1\u20134 players, you will search for a way out of the nightmare, solve deadly puzzles, and hide from relentless entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now, you have a new way to confront the unknown \u2014 <strong>your own voice</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your microphone to banish ghosts with words and interact with the world, discovering unexpected paths to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/4a9193ee6c9dba6fc71cacc7c3de62bd.avif?t=1768267858\" width=1280 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the world using your microphone \u2014 speak to increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/50d8b9a788ddbc99df4c9de9762d3202.poster.avif?t=1768267858\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/50d8b9a788ddbc99df4c9de9762d3202.webm?t=1768267858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/50d8b9a788ddbc99df4c9de9762d3202.mp4?t=1768267858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/c00dd211aaddeb529f1f7e311702857e.avif?t=1768267858\" width=1280 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find alternative escape routes by exploring dark corridors and unlocking hidden 